Package: freebuff
Version: 0.0.162
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: glibc, clang, curl, tar
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://codebuff.com
Description: Free, subscription-less AI coding agent for the terminal
 freebuff is a free AI coding agent that runs in your terminal — describe
 what you want and it edits your code, with no subscription or configuration
 required. Built on the Codebuff platform and adapted for Termux/Android.
 This package uses the glibc build and includes a wrapper to run
 inside Termux's glibc environment.
